<description>&lt;p&gt;Algeria has deployed troops to Niger to protect energy assets while Niger's security forces suffered a deadly NSCDC cell incident that killed 14 children among 33 detainees. Russian-affiliated forces in Mali have been reported killing civilians, and Russia hosted African leaders at a Moscow summit to deepen ties. In Niger, a convoy carrying Governor Bago collided with a car, killing four students, a driver and a young woman, and Niger accused Chad of a drone attack that killed two civilians. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTFBiY0dFTWJIZlNhS2NSU2E1Z0NKaUZnWHNGMlFYbjZTb1M0RzJ5SW5PY3dYSkRraENJQW5JazVOeXVwbTV1bXVqbEVaZzlnNm1NSXNrWTU4T3hvaFgzamVOeUM0bk5tQWRKbGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demokratis.co.id&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQeTV4QnA0OHQ1eVM5YmtrOEZqTUsxSHVhTXJockJqa0NCeFpMcC05UHE3UFZiMS1oYTVsRDZPV09QcHRaa3h2bUVIVDNfLS1TWnM1RFNibFZjNFBBZjFfNnNxRmRLWXdLd0JVWnZfazV1ajVtVXNPb1R6dU85R3ZwS0dEQVkxS04wY2lFeThHYzUtYk9HdEFISlpwLTlxLXdUR05vSFAweVpFd1VFb0gxaWtXNzlWdU43NWtzRk9uMG95RERP?oc=5&quot;&gt;Platform Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ACI Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNaWxKVWFjS0cyVWZ2dnUwV2JPdS1DSHEtaUVfNVBoWGFpZFNYRU5fTGFOQW5QaktvZkFxdFhMeVJwejJ2MXZ5TVNwY0ZYXzlGdGh2SFlWUHM4WHRDT1p4TmNCb3BiQTRGaWpBdk8ySFY3NE9HVkp0MVNaTzc4SnFYaDI1YTR6Rkh5MzFjN0plR1NGSUhMcWFJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Human Rights Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQV3lsSUpsbEVMTUhFU1hDWGNEZkF1bWNCdlZpbm9pSEplZmlkZkRicHpJd3BaakNBQmt5ZWZickpoSTNzYk41UFdkcms4SThlRHY0c2NTdjFUMEJwUDM3OGNHR09xTUMyakJYbVlaS2hidXpoV1JIMTZiUlFkX3pPb0xEN1ZFdUoydktvR0pObEpvM1dhUVJSdThhV1BEdw?o